  "rationale": "FX03 is a single-cell currency/unit normalization issue. The flagged rows have observed cost_currency U_USD, while the raw schedule of investments presents the relevant valuation columns with dollar signs and the cited position rows under Amortized Cost and Fair Value. The source supports USD-denominated costs, so retaining U_USD rather than normalized USD is a real extraction/normalization defect, not a source ambiguity."
